# Linux GUI applications inside Selene Shell (docs/XWINDOWS.md): the aurora-xwm window manager helper
# (python3 + python3-xlib), the GTK themes and icon themes that GTK 2/3/4 applications installed from
# the Store need to look right in light and dark mode, xdg-utils (xdg-open from applications) and
# x11-utils (xprop/xwininfo, for diagnostics).
python3
python3-xlib
gnome-themes-extra
adwaita-icon-theme
hicolor-icon-theme
xdg-utils
x11-utils
